<title>USA: Catalina Lighting Inc Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Catalina Lighting Inc Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operating Results For The Quarter Ended December 31,</p>
<p>					     1996		     1995</p>
<p> NET SALES		     $ 45,095,000	    $ 50,180,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME			    22,000		   588,000</p>
<p> PRIMARY  E.P.S.			  .01			 .08</p>
<p> FULLY DILUTED E.P.S.		   .01			 .08</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVG. PRIMARY SHARES</p>
<p>   OUTSTANDING		    7,808,000		 7,756,000</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVG. F.D. SHARES</p>
<p>   OUTSTANDING		    7,808,000		 7,756,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Legal fees from Black &amp; Decker Corp lawsuit against the company cut Q1 1996 earnings per share by $0.07.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
